e </c><00:00:09.068><c>Sun  </c><00:00:09.076><c>and </c><00:00:09.084><c>what </c><00:00:09.092><c>that's </c><00:00:09.100><c>doing </c><00:00:09.108><c>is </c><00:00:09.116><c>its </c><00:00:09.124><c>heating </c><00:00:09.132><c>up  </c><00:00:09.140><c>a </c><00:00:09.148><c>piece </c><00:00:09.156><c>of </c><00:00:09.164><c>wire </c><00:00:09.172><c>right </c><00:00:09.180><c>underneath </c><00:00:09.188><c>it </c><00:00:09.196><c>and  </c><00:00:09.204><c>it's </c><00:00:09.212><c>heating </c><00:00:09.220><c>up </c><00:00:09.228><c>a </c><00:00:09.236><c>very </c><00:00:09.244><c>specialized </c><00:00:09.252><c>piece  </c><00:00:09.260><c>of </c><00:00:09.268><c>wire </c><00:00:09.276><c>called </c><00:00:09.284><c>nitinol </c><00:00:09.292><c>that </c><00:00:09.300><c>that </c><00:00:09.308><c>wire </c><00:00:09.316><c>is  </c><00:00:09.324><c>a </c><00:00:09.332><c>special </c><00:00:09.340><c>two </c><00:00:09.348><c>alloy </c><00:00:09.356><c>made </c><00:00:09.364><c>of </c><00:00:09.372><c>nickel </c><00:00:09.380><c>and  </c><00:00:09.388><c>titanium </c><00:00:09.396><c>also </c><00:00:09.404><c>called </c><00:00:09.412><c>a </c><00:00:09.420><c>shape-memory  </c><00:00:09.428><c>alloy </c><00:00:09.436><c>or </c><00:00:09.444><c>a </c><00:00:09.452><c>muscle </c><00:00:09.460><c>wire </c><00:00:09.468><c>that </c><00:00:09.476><c>when </c><00:00:09.484><c>it </c><00:00:09.492><c>gets  </c><00:00:09.500><c>up </c><00:00:09.508><c>to </c><00:00:09.516><c>a </c><00:00:09.524><c>certain </c><00:00:09.532><c>temperature </c><00:00:09.540><c>it </c><00:00:09.548><c>contracts  </c><00:00:09.556><c>and </c><00:00:09.564><c>that </c><00:00:09.572><c>contraction </c><00:00:09.580><c>we </c><00:00:09.588><c>can </c><00:00:09.596><c>actually </c><00:00:09.604><c>use  </c><00:00:09.612><c>as </c><00:00:09.620><c>a </c><00:00:09.628><c>mechanical </c><00:00:09.636><c>trigger </c><00:00:09.644><c>for </c><00:00:09.652><c>the </c><00:00:09.660><c>clock  </c><00:00